{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39292","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:44.937937+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\n`jnp.linalg.eigh` on a batch of small symmetric float64 matrices\ncrashes with heap corruption on a many-core CPU host (SIGABRT with\n`corrupted size vs. prev_size`, or SIGSEGV).\n\n```python\nimport jax\njax.config.update(\"jax_enable_x64\", True)\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\na = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(0), (144, 63, 63), dtype=jnp.float64)\na = (a + jnp.swapaxes(a, -1, -2)) / 2   # symmetric\nw, v = jnp.linalg.eigh(a)               # <-- heap corruption\nw.block_until_ready()\nprint(\"OK\")\n```\n\n```\nJAX_PLATFORMS=cpu python -X faulthandler repro.py\n```\n\nOn a 256-logical-core host (2x AMD EPYC 7763)\n\n- a batch of 128 or fewer matrices runs fine, 144 crashes\n- a single 63x63 is fine\n- `OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=32` prints OK, 64 still crashes\n\nThe threshold scales with the core count. On a 128-core host batch\n144 passes and batch 1024 crashes, on jax 0.10.2 with SIGABRT and on\n0.11.0 with SIGSEGV.\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.10.2\njaxlib: 0.10.2\nnumpy:  2.5.0\npython: 3.12.11 (main, Aug  8 2025, 17:06:48) [Clang 20.1.4 ]\ndevice info: NVIDIA A100-SXM4-80GB-1, 1 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='l50003.lvt.dkrz.de', release='4.18.0-553.141.1.el8.x86_64', version='#1 SMP Thu Jul 9 20:00:37 CEST 2026', machine='x86_64')\n\n$ nvidia-smi\nSat Jul 18 16:37:44 2026\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| NVIDIA-SMI 580.159.04             Driver Version: 580.159.04     CUDA Version: 13.0     |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n| GPU  Name                 Persistence-M | Bus-Id          Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\n| Fan  Temp   Perf          Pwr:Usage/Cap |           Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\n|                                         |                        |               MIG M. |\n|=========================================+========================+======================|\n|   0  NVIDIA A100-SXM4-80GB          On  |   00000000:44:00.0 Off |                    0 |\n| N/A   44C    P0             85W /  500W |   65851MiB /  81920MiB |      3%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Processes:                                                                              |\n|  GPU   GI   CI              PID   Type   Process name                        GPU Memory |\n|        ID   ID                                                               Usage      |\n|=========================================================================================|\n|    0   N/A  N/A         4035478      C   ...m/fridom-dev/.venv/bin/python      65408MiB |\n|    0   N/A  N/A         4050582      C   .../fridom-dev/.venv/bin/python3        424MiB |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39292/comments","created_at":"2026-07-18T14:42:55Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39292/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/39292","id":4918701219,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782