rl":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SakshamKapoor2911","id":124176804,"login":"SakshamKapoor2911","node_id":"U_kgDOB2bJpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakshamKapoor2911","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2026-07-22T18:07:42Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"Fixes #39292.\n\n## Problem\n\n`jnp.linalg.eigh` (and potentially other batched LAPACK operations) causes heap corruption on machines with many CPU cores (256+). The root cause is thread oversubscription: JAX dispatches batched LAPACK calls across the XLA thread pool via `ParallelBatchMap`, and each individual call independently spawns `OMP_NUM_THREADS` threads through OpenBLAS, leading to N×N thread explosion and corrupted internal OpenBLAS workspace buffers.\n\n## Fix\n\nAdded an `OpenblasThreadGuard` RAII class that sets `OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1` before dispatching to the thread pool, and restores the original value when all tasks complete. A `shared_ptr<OpenblasThreadGuard>` is captured by each thread-pool task lambda, keeping the environment set for the lifetime of all concurrent tasks.\n\nThe fix is placed in the `#ifdef PLATFORM_GOOGLE` path (where `ParallelBatchMap` actually uses the thread pool). The open-source `#else` path already serializes LAPACK calls, so there is no behavioral change for open-source builds.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Verified C++ syntax with `g++ -std=c++17`\n- Verified save/restore semantics of the guard in a standalone test\n- All batched eigh / eigvalsh / cholesky / SVD / QR tests pass on 32-core machine\n- **Note**: The bug requires 256+ cores to reproduce and the `PLATFORM_GOOGLE` build path, which is not available in local testing. CI verification on Google-internal infrastructure is needed to confirm the fix works on high-core-count machines.\n\n## Changes\n\nSingle file: `jaxlib/cpu/lapack_kernels.cc` (+32/-1 lines)","closed_at":null,"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39383/comments","created_at":"2026-07-22T18:07:41Z","draft":false,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39383/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/39383","id":4951789426,"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39383/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"PR_kwDOCTkjjc71Am4m","number":39383,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pull_request":{"diff_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/39383.diff","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/39383","merged_at":null,"patch_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/39383.patch","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/pulls/39383"},"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/39383/reactions"},"repository":{"allow_forking":true,"archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/{archive_format}{/ref}","archived":false,"assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com